WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:02.545
There are many different balls.

2
00:00:02.546 --> 00:00:07.876
Balls come in many sizes and shapes.

3
00:00:07.877 --> 00:00:11.240
I am black, white, and round.

4
00:00:11.241 --> 00:00:14.147
What am I?

5
00:00:14.148 --> 00:00:17.648
I am a soccer ball.

6
00:00:17.649 --> 00:00:21.353
How can you play with me?

7
00:00:21.354 --> 00:00:26.378
You can kick me!

8
00:00:26.379 --> 00:00:30.873
I am orange and round with thin black stripes.

9
00:00:30.874 --> 00:00:33.245
What am I?

10
00:00:33.246 --> 00:00:36.490
I am a basketball.

11
00:00:36.491 --> 00:00:40.005
How can you play with me?

12
00:00:40.006 --> 00:00:45.937
You can shoot me into a hoop!

13
00:00:45.938 --> 00:00:49.925
I am brown and I am shaped like an oval.

14
00:00:49.926 --> 00:00:52.668
What am I?

15
00:00:52.669 --> 00:00:56.084
I am a football.

16
00:00:56.085 --> 00:00:59.666
How can you play with me?

17
00:00:59.667 --> 00:01:05.396
You can throw me and kick me!

18
00:01:05.397 --> 00:01:10.578
I am small, round, white, and hard.

19
00:01:10.579 --> 00:01:13.529
What am I?

20
00:01:13.530 --> 00:01:16.277
I am a baseball.

21
00:01:16.278 --> 00:01:19.564
How can you play with me?

22
00:01:19.565 --> 00:01:25.056
You can hit me with a bat!

23
00:01:25.057 --> 00:01:31.323
I am round, small, fuzzy, bouncy, and bright yellow.

24
00:01:31.324 --> 00:01:34.053
What am I?

25
00:01:34.054 --> 00:01:37.381
I am a tennis ball.

26
00:01:37.382 --> 00:01:40.844
How can you play with me?

27
00:01:40.845 --> 00:01:46.719
You can hit me with a racket!

28
00:01:46.720 --> 00:01:50.497
I am tiny, white, and bumpy.

29
00:01:50.498 --> 00:01:53.734
What am I?

30
00:01:53.735 --> 00:01:57.066
I am a golf ball.

31
00:01:57.067 --> 00:02:00.445
How can you play with me?

32
00:02:00.446 --> 00:02:05.927
You can swing a club and hit me!

33
00:02:05.928 --> 00:02:08.853
What's your favorite ball?

34
00:02:08.854 --> 00:02:13.355
"Pick me! Pick me!"

